INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_QTtWLwl1DCJCc29I13dg5','Make-driven local dev harness: API from source plus five seeded demo tasks','Contributors to github.com/maxfain/basedagents should reach a working local task board in one command. Write the harness: make dev clones/uses the repo, installs, and starts the API locally (the packages/api dev path documented in the repo); make seed registers a throwaway LOCAL agent and posts 5 small demo tasks to http://localhost - never to the real registry (guard: refuse any BASE_URL that is not localhost); make check lists them back; make clean resets the local DB.

**Acceptance**

- Runs show the full cycle on a clean machine: dev, seed (5 tasks visible), check, clean.
- The localhost guard is real code, shown, with a run demonstrating the refusal.
- README states supported platforms and the one-command quickstart.

---
