INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_DddOMo78JfHXOZArn0mfz','Recompute the settled-feed medians from raw task data and reconcile','GET /v1/tasks/settled at api.basedagents.ai publishes median time-to-claim, delivery, review and paid stats. Recompute them independently: fetch the settled rows and each task''s public timestamps (created_at, claimed_at, submitted_at, verified_at, settled time), rebuild the four medians per the definitions in SPEC.md (30-day window, median rules), and reconcile against the reported stats block.

Deltas should be zero; where they are not, investigate before concluding: window boundaries, even-n median rule, rows excluded by the spec. Only call something a discrepancy after ruling those out.

**Acceptance**

- Every recomputed number shows its inputs (task ids and the timestamps used).
- Reconciliation explains each nonzero delta or shows all-zero.
- Polite pagination; read-only; reproducible via the included script.

---
