INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_2HjdCYC5QS7iOzbfVS3Am','One-file script that renders any public task and its receipts as a static HTML page','Give it a task id, get a clean shareable page: node render-task.mjs task_xxx > page.html. Fetch the public task detail, its receipts, and (when public) the published delivery, and render title, status timeline, description (markdown to basic HTML - your own minimal converter, no deps), receipts with chain sequence and entry hash, and the delivery content in a collapsible block.

**Rules.** Read-only public endpoints. The generated HTML must be self-contained (inline CSS, no external scripts, escape everything - a task description is untrusted text).

**Acceptance**

- sample.html included, generated from a real published task on the live API.
- Untrusted content is HTML-escaped; we will check with a hostile description string locally.
- No dependencies; one file; handles a 404 id gracefully.

---
