INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_BKYqxXI0P548P8pTkUIS4','Map the public Base-chain tooling an autonomous agent needs, with documented limits','An agent settling USDC on Base needs infrastructure: RPC endpoints, an explorer API, event indexing, and price data. Map the public options with their documented free-tier limits.

**For each category, at least 3 options**, including at least one that needs no API key. Record auth requirements and quote the documented rate or usage limits exactly (null if unstated — don''t infer).

**Rules.** Read docs; you may make a handful of unauthenticated read-only calls to confirm an endpoint is live (well under any published limit), nothing more.

**Acceptance**

- Every limit is a quote from the provider''s docs, or null.
- At least one keyless option per category, if any exists; say so if none does.
- starter_stack recommends a concrete minimal set and labels it opinion.

---
